gin=\"4\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(12,25,4)\">2Kgs 25:4</ref> = <ref ref=\"Jer 34:4\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(24,34,4)\">Jer 34:4</ref> = <ref ref=\"Jer 52:7\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(24,52,7)\">Jer 52:7</ref> symbol of Israel, <ref ref=\"Amos 7:7\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(30,7,7)\">Amos 7:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 8:5\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(14,8,5)\">2Chr 8:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 14:6\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(14,14,6)\">2Chr 14:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 25:23\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(14,25,23)\">2Chr 25:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 26:6\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(14,26,6)\">2Chr 26:6</ref> (3 t. in verse); <ref ref=\"Ps 51:20\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(19,51,20)\">Ps 51:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 1:3\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(16,1,3)\">Neh 1:3</ref> + 31 t. in Nehemiah; <bdbheb>חוֺמַת אֲנָךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 7:7\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(30,7,7)\">Amos 7:7</ref> (literally <highlight>wall of a plummet</highlight>) is of doubtful meaning: <highlight>a wall built plumb</highlight>, or <highlight>by means of a plumb-line ?</highlight> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup> thinks unintelligible; <bdbheb>עִיר חוֺמָה</bdbheb> = <highlight>walled city</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Lev 25:29\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(3,25,29)\">Lev 25:29</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עִיר אשׁר לֹא ח</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Lev 25:30\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(3,25,30)\">Lev 25:30</ref> (<bdbheb>לֹא</bdbheb> = <bdbheb>לוֺ</bdbheb>), opposed to <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַחֲצֵרִים אשׁר אין להם ח</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Lev 25:31\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(3,25,31)\">Lev 25:31</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('H')\"><reflink>H</reflink></lookup>); more elaborately <bdbheb>גְבֹהָה דְּלָתַיִם וּבְרִ֑יחַ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עָרִים בְּצֻרֹת ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 3:5\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(5,3,5)\">Deut 3:5</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"2Chr 8:5\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(14,8,5)\">2Chr 8:5</ref> <bdbheb>גְּדֹלוֺת חוֺמָה וּבְרִיחַ נְחשֶׁת</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 4:13\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(11,4,13)\">1Kgs 4:13</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בְצוּרָה ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 2:15\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(23,2,15)\">Isa 2:15</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> singular of wall of Jerusalem <ref ref=\"1Kgs 3:1\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(11,3,1)\">1Kgs 3:1</ref> + often; contempt. <bdbheb>חוֺמַת אַבְנֵיהֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Neh 3:35\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(16,3,35)\">Neh 3:35</ref> less often plural <ref ref=\"Neh 2:13\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(16,2,13)\">Neh 2:13</ref> +; of specific portions of wall <bdbheb>הָעֹפֶל</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 27:3\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(14,27,3)\">2Chr 27:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 3:27\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(16,3,27)\">Neh 3:27</ref> <bdbheb>בְּרֵבַת הַשֶּׁלַח</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Neh 3:15\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(16,3,15)\">Neh 3:15</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַח</bdbheb> <bdbheb>הָֽרְחָבָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Neh 3:8\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(16,3,8)\">Neh 3:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 12:38\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,38)\">Neh 12:38</ref> also (generally) of Babylon <ref ref=\"Jer 51:58\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"58\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"58\" onclick=\"bcv(24,51,58)\">Jer 51:58</ref>. — Men <highlight>build</highlight>, <bdbheb>בנה</bdbheb>, the <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 9:15\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(11,9,15)\">1Kgs 9:15</ref> +, especially (of rebuilding), <ref ref=\"Neh 2:17\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(16,2,17)\">Neh 2:17</ref> +; fortify it <bdbheb>בִּצֵּר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 22:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,22,10)\">Isa 22:10</ref> it is <highlight>joined together</highlight> <bdbheb>קשׁר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Neh 3:38\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(16,3,38)\">Neh 3:38</ref> is <highlight>repaired</highlight> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עָֽלְתָה אֲרוּכָה לְח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Neh 4:1\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(16,4,1)\">Neh 4:1</ref> it <highlight>falls</highlight> <bdbheb>נפל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 6:5\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(6,6,5)\">Josh 6:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 6:20\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(6,6,20)\">Josh 6:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 20:30\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(11,20,30)\">1Kgs 20:30</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 38:20\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(26,38,20)\">Ezek 38:20</ref> the enemy <highlight>makes it fall</highlight> <bdbheb>הִפִּיל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 20:15\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(10,20,15)\">2Sam 20:15</ref> (preceded by <bdbheb>מַשְׁחִית</bdbheb> si vera lectio, see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup>); <highlight>destroys</highlight> it <bdbheb>הִשְׁחִית</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lam 2:8\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(25,2,8)\">Lam 2:8</ref> <bdbheb>שִׁהֵת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 26:4\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(26,26,4)\">Ezek 26:4</ref> <highlight>makes a breach in it</highlight> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>פָּרַץ בּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 14:13\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(12,14,13)\">2Kgs 14:13</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 25:23\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(14,25,23)\">2Chr 25:23</ref>, compare <bdbheb>פרץ</bdbheb> with accusative <ref ref=\"2Chr 26:6\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(14,26,6)\">2Chr 26:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 3:35\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(16,3,35)\">Neh 3:35</ref>, and <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וֶיִּבֶן אֶתכֿלהֿח</bdbheb> <bdbheb>הַפְּרוּצָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 32:5\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(14,32,5)\">2Chr 32:5</ref> also (in simile) <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עִיר פְּרוּצָה ואין ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 25:28\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(20,25,28)\">Prov 25:28</ref> and Punic participle <bdbheb>מְפֹרָ֑צֶת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Neh 1:3\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(16,1,3)\">Neh 1:3</ref> one <highlight>breakes it down</highlight> <bdbheb>נָתַץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 25:10\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(12,25,10)\">2Kgs 25:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 36:19\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(14,36,19)\">2Chr 36:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 39:8\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(24,39,8)\">Jer 39:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 52:14\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(24,52,14)\">Jer 52:14</ref> <highlight>tears it down</highlight> <bdbheb>הָרַס</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 26:12\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(26,26,12)\">Ezek 26:12</ref>, compare passive <ref ref=\"Jer 50:15\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(24,50,15)\">Jer 50:15</ref> Amos predicts that <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> will <highlight>send fire</highlight> into wall (of Gaza, etc.): <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וְשִׁלַּחְתִּי אֵשׁ בְּח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 1:7\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(30,1,7)\">Amos 1:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Amos 1:10\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(30,1,10)\">Amos 1:10</ref> or <highlight>kindle fire in</highlight> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וְהִצַּתִּי אֵשׁ בְּח</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Amos 1:14\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(30,1,14)\">Amos 1:14</ref>, so <ref ref=\"Jer 49:27\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(24,49,27)\">Jer 49:27</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>wall</highlight> of a building: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> citadel, fortress; <bdbheb>ארמנותיה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lam 2:7\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(25,2,7)\">Lam 2:7</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> surrounding new temple <ref ref=\"Ezek 40:5\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(26,40,5)\">Ezek 40:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 42:20\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(26,42,20)\">Ezek 42:20</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> figurative of waters of Red Sea <ref ref=\"Exod 14:22\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(2,14,22)\">Exod 14:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 14:29\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(2,14,29)\">Exod 14:29</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), compare <ref ref=\"Nah 3:8\" b=\"34\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(34,3,8)\">Nah 3:8</ref> of David's men as protectors of Nabal's shepherds <ref ref=\"1Sam 25:16\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(9,25,16)\">1Sam 25:16</ref> of prophet as object of assault <bdbheb>חוֺמַת נְחשֶׁת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 1:18\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(24,1,18)\">Jer 1:18</ref> <bdbheb>נחשׁת בְּצוּרָה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 15:20\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(24,15,20)\">Jer 15:20</ref> of strong, virtuous woman <ref ref=\"Song 8:9\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(22,8,9)\">Song 8:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Song 8:10\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(22,8,10)\">Song 8:10</ref> of salvation, <bdbheb>יְשׁוּעָה</bdbheb>, as defence <ref ref=\"Isa 26:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,26,1)\">Isa 26:1</ref> (|| <bdbheb>חֵל</bdbheb>); of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> himself <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <bdbheb>אֵשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Zech 2:9\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(38,2,9)\">Zech 2:9</ref> a dangerous political scheme is called breach in <bdbheb>נִשְׁגָּבָה</bdbh